Scope of Work

Project Title: Personal Book Catalogue
Student Name: Sue Moon
Date: 10/14/2025

Project Overview:
The project will store a number of books in its inventory to serve as the catalogue with the user being able to add new books into said catalogue.
The program is able to let the user search for a specific book using name or author. The program will display the searched book's location and a short summary of said book.
Otherwise, the program will display that the book is not in the catalogue or not owned by the user.

Goals:
1. Able to add books into the catalogue
2. Search function to look for books in the catalogue
3. Displays location and availability of books in catalogue or displays the books is not owned

Deliverables: 
Program files (main.coo + others)
Output.pdf with screenshots and explanation
GitHub submission with correct file structure

Timeline:
Week 1-2: Define idea & set up GitHub
Week 3-4: Build Program features
Week 5: Test & debug
Week 6: Write Output.pdf
Week 7: Submit final project

Success Criteria: The project runs correctly, includes required features, and all files are submitted on time.
